  "abstract": "Replicate the strong FourierForecasterLN (RFFT-based, p=36) and ablate dropout to 0.05 (vs 0.10) in both the frequency MLP and ResidualCopyHead. Optimizer: Adam lr=1e-3 with global clip=1.0. Loss: MAE + temporal curvature (\u03bb=1e-4).",
